{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":3,"title":"문자열 속 숫자 꺼내기","desc":"<p>문자열에서 <b>연속된 숫자 덩어리</b>를 모두 찾아 <b>숫자 벡터</b>로 돌려주는 <code>extract_numbers(s)</code>를 만드세요. 숫자가 없으면 빈 벡터예요. 예: <code>\"a12b345\"</code> → <code>c(12, 345)</code></p>","solution":"extract_numbers <- function(s) {\n  as.numeric(regmatches(s, gregexpr(\"[0-9]+\", s))[[1]])\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>gregexpr()</code>로 위치를 찾고 <code>regmatches()</code>로 그 부분을 꺼낸 뒤 <code>as.numeric()</code>으로 바꿔요. 반환값이 리스트이니 <code>[[1]]</code>.</p>","tests":[{"call":"extract_numbers(\"a12b345\")","expected":[12,345],"visible":true},{"call":"extract_numbers(\"no digits\")","expected":[],"visible":true},{"call":"extract_numbers(\"1 2 3\")","expected":[1,2,3],"visible":false},{"call":"extract_numbers(\"x7y8\")","expected":[7,8],"visible":false}],"starter":"extract_numbers <- function(s) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-331"}